#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Entry strategy selector for stage0 local orchestration.

Selects ranked entry strategies based on tier + founder_strength + network_quality.
Returns prioritized list with first actions and kill signals.

Input:  --tier <TIER_X> --founder-strength <class> --network-quality <level>
        [--ecosystem <keywords>]
Output: JSON {strategies: [{name, priority, capital_required, time_to_first_dollar,
                            first_action, kill_signal}]}

5 Entry Strategies:
- SERVICE_RENTAL:       Rent time/skill to ecosystem players
- INFORMATION_ARBITRAGE: Package information others pay to learn
- BROKERAGE:            Connect buyers and sellers, take referral fee
- APPRENTICE:           Get hired by existing player, learn on their dime
- MICRO_PRODUCT:        Build smallest possible paid product

Plan ref: plans/260419-0828-stage0-capital-path-upgrade/phase-01-core-scripts.md
"""

